          <span style="color: var(--primary-light); font-size: 1.25rem;">✓</span>
          <span><strong>Iscriviti all'Associazione</strong> e usufruisci di sconti nei negozi convenzionati.</span>
        </li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <span style="color: var(--primary-light); font-size: 1.25rem;">✓</span>
          <span><strong>Dona il 5x1000</strong> nella tua dichiarazione dei redditi (C.F. 90050850371<button class="copy-btn" data-copy="90050850371" title="Copia Codice Fiscale" aria-label="Copia Codice Fiscale"><svg class="copy-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path></svg><svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="display: none;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></button>).</span>
        </li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <span style="color: var(--primary-light); font-size: 1.25rem;">✓</span>
          <span><strong>Collabora come volontario</strong> portando le tue idee e dedicando un po' del tuo tempo.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/associazione/" class="btn btn-primary">Come Associarsi &rarr;</a>
    </div>
    <div class="callout-image">
      {% image "/assets/images/batti-il-cinque.png", "Dona il 5x1000", [400, 800], "(max-width: 992px) 100vw, 400px" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

